# ====================================================================
# STM32CubeIDE Git Ignore Template
# ====================================================================

# 1. Build Outputs (Vary depending on your configuration Build Target)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
Debug/
Release/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
Tests/

# 2. Binary and Compilation Artifacts
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
*.elf
*.map
*.bin
*.hex
*.srec
*.lst
*.o
*.obj
*.d
*.a
*.su
*.crl

# 3. Eclipse & Workspace Metadata (Machine-Specific Logs & Traces)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
.metadata/
*.log
*.bak

# 4. Debugger Logs & Hardware Hardware Adapter Temporary Files
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
*.jlink
.STMicroelectronics/

# 5. AI Agent / Assistant Files (local only, never commit)
# --------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
.agent/
.agents/
.cursor/
.aider*
.continue/
.codex/
.gemini/
.windsurf/
.copilot/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md
